This licence covers the code only. The data does not travel with it: every
source in `src/migratlas/catalog/registry.yaml` carries its own terms, several
forbid redistribution, and one (`movebank_svalbard_reindeer`, CC BY-NC 4.0)
restricts commercial use of anything derived from it. See
`docs/data/PROVENANCE.md`, which is generated from the registry.

The bundled fonts under `web/src/assets/fonts/` are SIL OFL 1.1 and carry their
own licence text at `web/public/fonts/`. The OFL requires that text to travel
with the font; it is not build noise and must not be pruned.
